{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "先做这几件",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 68.24,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "按角色，各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "按决色，各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 1.695,
   "speechEnd": 3.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "写智能账户的，签名覆盖链 ID 和入口合约地址，管理操作防跨链重放。",
   "spoken": "写智能账户的，签名覆盖链 ID 和入口合约地址，管理操作防跨链虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 3.9,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 3.99,
   "speechEnd": 10.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "做钱包的，只委托给自己审计过的实现，批量逐项解码。",
   "spoken": "做钱包的，只委托给自己审计过的实现，批亮逐项解码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 10.52,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 10.52,
   "speechEnd": 15.081
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "写合约的，别再用交易发起者，判断对方是普通地址。",
   "spoken": "写合约的，别再用交易发起者，判断对方是普通地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 15.54,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 15.54,
   "speechEnd": 19.69
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "托管方，不需要委托的热钱包，一律拒签这类授权，自有地址的代码一变，立刻告警。",
   "spoken": "托管方，不需要委托的热钱包，一律拒签这类授权，自有地址的代码一变，立刻告警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 20.16,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 20.16,
   "speechEnd": 27.275
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "普通用户，网站请你升级成智能账户，拒绝，看不懂批量里的任何一步，不签。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，网站请你升级成智能账户，拒绝，看不懂批亮里的任何一步，不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 27.66,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 27.66,
   "speechEnd": 34.391
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "用完的会话密钥和 Permit2 旧授权，记得撤销。",
   "spoken": "用完的会话密钥和 Permit2 旧授权，记得撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 34.84,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 34.84,
   "speechEnd": 38.707
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "回到开头的问题，服务关了，委托不会自动失效。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题，服务关了，委托不会自动失效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 39.14,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 39.14,
   "speechEnd": 43.181
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "委托是写在地址上的链上状态，要靠一笔新的授权清零。",
   "spoken": "委托是写在地址上的链上状态，要靠一笔新的授权清零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 43.6,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 43.6,
   "speechEnd": 48.614
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "那次事件里，约 3 小时 50 分后，委托才被清零。",
   "spoken": "那次事件里，约 3 小时 50 分后，委托才被清零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 49.02,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 49.02,
   "speechEnd": 52.89
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "停掉链下服务，无法撤销链上的委托。",
   "spoken": "停掉链下服务，无法撤销链上的委托。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 53.32,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 53.416,
   "speechEnd": 56.539
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "账户变成了合约，签名就是在授权代码，签之前，先看清它允许什么。",
   "spoken": "账户变成了合约，签名就是在授权代码，签之前，先看清它允许什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 56.98,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 57.076,
   "speechEnd": 63.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "下一集讲共识层与链本身的安全。",
   "spoken": "下一集讲共识层与链本身的安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
